      "writtenOn": "2019-12-05T00:29:52Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "to facilitate learning for ONOS users, it is usually better to name commands with the object first and verb after, e.g. attachment-activate, so by typing attachment one gets autocompletion for all related commands. Can you please make this change to all commands?",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 29,
        "startChar": 32,
